A palindrome expands from its center.

For:

"babad"

The center can be:

b a b
  ↑
center

or:

a b a
  ↑
center

We need to check both types:

Odd-length palindrome
"aba"
 ↑
center character
Even-length palindrome
"abba"
  ↑
center is between b and b
